          "inLanguage": "en",
          "mainEntity": [
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "What can we do for our anniversary instead of a restaurant?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Revisit a memory from when you met, prepare a simple meal and exchange letters. If you both want to, add a Caresse audio experience for an intimate moment at home."
              }
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "Do these ideas work for a civil partnership or wedding anniversary?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Yes. These ideas cover dating, civil partnership and wedding anniversaries. Choose a memory and atmosphere that reflect your story, whether this is your first year or a later milestone."
              }
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "How can we celebrate on a budget or at the last minute?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "A playlist, a favourite meal and a handwritten note can mark the occasion. Caresse demos are free; personalised sessions use paid credits, with no subscription."
              }
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "Can I give Caresse as an anniversary gift?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "You can suggest an experience to share in the app, choosing preferences together. It is not a gift voucher: this page offers neither gift cards nor credit transfers to another person."
              }
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "What is a personal wedding anniversary gift idea?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "A letter, a meal connected to your story and an experience chosen together can make a personal gift, whether it is your first year or a later anniversary. Caresse can accompany the occasion with a free demo or a paid personalised audio session. This page offers neither gift vouchers nor credit transfers."
              }
            },
            {
              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "How can we celebrate a civil partnership anniversary at home?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "Choose a memory from the start of your life together, prepare a playlist and a meal you enjoy, then make time without interruptions. Add an audio discovery if you both want to. Adapt the details to your story rather than following a fixed programme."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
