                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "h2",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "section-title",
                        "id": "faq-title"
                      },
                      "html": "Planning your anniversary together"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "container",
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-list"
                  },
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>What can we do for our anniversary instead of a restaurant?</summary><p>Revisit a memory from when you met, prepare a simple meal and exchange letters. If you both want to, add a Caresse audio experience for an intimate moment at home.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>Do these ideas work for a civil partnership or wedding anniversary?</summary><p>Yes. These ideas cover dating, civil partnership and wedding anniversaries. Choose a memory and atmosphere that reflect your story, whether this is your first year or a later milestone.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>How can we celebrate on a budget or at the last minute?</summary><p>A playlist, a favourite meal and a handwritten note can mark the occasion. Caresse demos are free; personalised sessions use paid credits, with no subscription.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>Can I give Caresse as an anniversary gift?</summary><p>You can suggest an experience to share in the app, choosing preferences together. It is not a gift voucher: this page offers neither gift cards nor credit transfers to another person.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>What is a personal wedding anniversary gift idea?</summary><p>A letter, a meal connected to your story and an experience chosen together can make a personal gift, whether it is your first year or a later anniversary. Caresse can accompany the occasion with a free demo or a paid personalised audio session. This page offers neither gift vouchers nor credit transfers.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>How can we celebrate a civil partnership anniversary at home?</summary><p>Choose a memory from the start of your life together, prepare a playlist and a meal you enjoy, then make time without interruptions. Add an audio discovery if you both want to. Adapt the details to your story rather than following a fixed programme.</p>"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
